*================================================================*
* Encyclopedia - Entity Definition
* Entity  : AUTHORITY-USER
* Desc    : Represents an authorised officer/authority who can
*           perform approvals in the license issuance workflow
*================================================================*

ENTITY: AUTHORITY-USER
  IDENTIFIER:
    AUTHORITY-USER-ID            NUMERIC(10)       NOT NULL

  ATTRIBUTES:
    USER-CODE                    CHARACTER(20)     NOT NULL
    USER-NAME                    CHARACTER(60)     NOT NULL
    AUTHORITY-NAME               CHARACTER(50)     NOT NULL   * e.g. Traffic Dept, DMV
    AUTHORITY-LEVEL              CHARACTER(1)      NOT NULL   * 1=First Approver, 2=Second Approver
    DEPARTMENT                   CHARACTER(50)
    PHONE-NUMBER                 CHARACTER(15)
    EMAIL-ADDRESS                CHARACTER(60)
    ACTIVE-STATUS                CHARACTER(1)      NOT NULL   * A=Active, I=Inactive
    LICENSE-TYPES-AUTHORISED     CHARACTER(3)                 * L/P/O or combinations e.g. LPO

  RELATIONSHIPS:
    PERFORMS-ZERO-OR-MORE        LICENSE-APPLICATION          * via approval fields

  VALIDATION:
    AUTHORITY-LEVEL IN ('1', '2')
    ACTIVE-STATUS IN ('A', 'I')
